  "scope": "FC1 software enable to active-low bypass register and CBC chunk; independent of coefficient/control word.",
  "observations": [
    "FC1 constructor installs vtable 0x804ff9f0, low-level ID 13, enable-write address 0xb60000ec, disabled value 1 and enabled value 0.",
    "UpdateFilterFiplibEnable low-level ID 13 reads only u8 at payload+0x44, passes (byte==0) to vtable+0x24, bound to CFilter::SetEnabled(0x804ff648). It stores the boolean at filter+0x28.",
    "CFilter::WriteEnable and WriteEnableToCbc use filter+0x28 to choose enabled value +0x14 or disabled value +0x10. The direct store and CBC pair carry identical address/value.",
    "Enable register 0xb60000ec is separate from FC1 packed-control register 0xb60000fc. Neither write verifies physical pixels."
  ],
